  "sourceText": "Mulberry Jam\nBy: Sheri Wetherell\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 5:16pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n4 cups mulberries\n3 cups sugar\n2 tablespoons lemon juice\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Wash mulberries 2 Combine with sugar and lemon juice cook until thick 3 Hot pack into sterilized jars and process in a water bath canner for 10 minutes",
